  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/02/InaugPeluqueriaAtrevete-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p>(16 fotos) La tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles ha abierto sus puertas la nueva Peluquer&iacute;a Atr&eacute;vete, en la calle R&iacute;o Mijares, 6 de Onda. Con Eva Mar&iacute;a Garc&iacute;a Roca y Patri Albalate Osuna, como peluqueras, y Tamar Gonz&aacute;lez Guill&eacute;n en el apartado de est&eacute;tica, estar&aacute; abierta de 9 a 13.30 horas y de 15.30 a 20 horas, de lunes a viernes, y de 9 a 15 horas, el s&aacute;bado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete080217/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete-1.jpg\" alt=\"inaugpeluqueriaatrevete-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete080217/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete-2.jpg\" alt=\"inaugpeluqueriaatrevete-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete080217/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete-3.jpg\" alt=\"inaugpeluqueriaatrevete-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete080217/p1460438.jpg\" alt=\"p1460438\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete080217/p1460439.jpg\" alt=\"p1460439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete080217/p1460440.jpg\" alt=\"p1460440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugpeluqueriaatrevete080217/p1460442.jpg\" alt=\"p1460442\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a9